      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test file with better variable names, a descriptive test method name, removed unused imports, and inline comments explaining the arithmetic.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version replaces cryptic auto-generated variable names (`seconds0`, `seconds1`, `duration0`, `boolean0`) with descriptive ones (`initialSeconds`, `reducedSeconds`, `subtractionDuration`, `areEqual`), removes unused imports, and adds inline comments explaining the arithmetic (396 hours × 3600 = 1,425,600 seconds) and the immutability verification — all while preserving identical runtime behavior."
    }
